      children: "Automated Evaluations and Testing"
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "Manual testing of prompt outputs doesn't scale past the prototype phase. You need automated evaluation pipelines that run against every prompt version change, just like you run unit tests against code changes. The challenge is that LLM outputs are rarely deterministic, so traditional assertion-based testing falls short. Instead, implement evaluation frameworks that assess output quality across multiple dimensions: format compliance, factual accuracy, stylistic consistency, and task completion."
